[Quotes]
victory1 = "I’m so tired of killing. I just want to be a kid. Hanging out, doing stuff with Gon. That’s it."
victory2 = "Assassination it’s the family trade. We all take it up. My folks see me as an exceptional prospect. But I don’t see that I should have to live up to their expectations."
victory3 = "The stronger someone is, the better they are at hiding that strength."
victory4 = "It’s foolish to show your hand when the odds are against you. That’s my dad’s logic."
victory5 = "When I say it doesn’t hurt me, that means I can bear it."
victory6 = "Not killing people is really hard. Clean living is tough."

